# GENERATED CHARACTERIZATION SPECS (CART-0262). Deliberately ignored: a
# characterization spec is SUPPOSED to fail when behaviour changes, so committing one
# would turn every legitimate refactor into a red diff. Generate, run, discard — or
# move it out of here by hand once you have decided it is a real test.
characterized/
# CART-0991: counterexample-generated tests, PENDING review. Same rule as
# `characterized/` above — a machine-written test is a local artifact until a human
# confirms the behaviour, deletes its PENDING line and MOVES it into tests/.
tests/generated/
*_char.lua

